              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abu keneru kotauka, katema atiar, “Koany, adum acoa naepol adepar kere lukageikinete eoŋ ko Yerusalem: eebo, adumu ekatau acoa naepol noi ka aijen.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
