              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abu kebwaik ekatau aijen acoa, aijen da ikerep, ka abaŋaanut: abu kaienu ebe eraas ŋun da ainyam ekwam.",
          "type": "text",
